  "scope": "Actual continuous divided Gaussian-noise coefficients are positive and satisfy two-sided global score-range envelopes: exp(+-C(tau R sqrt(L)+tau^2 R^2))/sqrt(1-r^2). The proof uses the actual Gaussian facet-weight range envelope, the actual midpoint path contraction, exact mass Jacobian, and interval integration. It remains valid on score ties. No coefficient-bound premise or full-span assumption is used. Smooth majorants and Lq moments are subsequent work."
